# Hindustan Times

> Founded in 1924, Hindustan Times is one of India's leading English-language news publishers across print and digital media. It delivers real-time breaking news, national and world politics, business and finance, sports, defense, entertainment, lifestyle, education, astrology, viral trends, and global affairs.

Hindustan Times is published by HT Media Ltd and headquartered in New Delhi, India. Its sister titles-Mint (business/financial daily, livemint.com) and Hindustan (Hindi-language daily, livehindustan.com)-are separate properties with their own websites and are not covered by this file.

Official website: https://www.hindustantimes.com/

Most articles on hindustantimes.com are free to read; some content is limited to HT Premium subscribers. The pages linked below are section/category landing pages that refresh continuously rather than fixed documents, and hindustantimes.com does not currently publish separate Markdown (.md) versions of its pages, so all linked URLs are standard HTML pages. For the freshest individual article URLs, prefer the XML sitemaps listed under Optional over the static category links in this file.

## Core Sections

- [Latest News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/latest-news): Recently published Hindustan Times journalism and breaking developments.
- [India News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news): Major national politics, government policy, Supreme Court verdicts, and state governance.
- [Entertainment News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment): Cinema, Bollywood, Hollywood, web series, and popular culture coverage.
- [Cricket News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/cricket): Indian cricket team updates, IPL, match schedules, and ball-by-ball analysis.
- [Business](https://www.hindustantimes.com/business): Macroeconomic trends, Indian markets, corporate news, and personal finance.
- [Technology](https://www.hindustantimes.com/technology): Consumer electronics, software development, cybersecurity, and global tech industry updates.
- [AI News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/ai): Developments in artificial intelligence, machine learning, and tech policy.
- [HT Explainers](https://www.hindustantimes.com/ht-explainers): In-depth backgrounders, key takeaways, and context on complex news events.
- [Opinion](https://www.hindustantimes.com/opinion): Columns, editorial analysis, expert perspectives, and commentary.
- [Trending News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/trending): Viral internet trends, social media discussions, and popular online topics.
- [Real Estate News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/real-estate): Housing infrastructure, property market updates, and urban policy.
- [Astrology](https://www.hindustantimes.com/astrology): Daily horoscopes, astrological predictions, and zodiac guides.
- [Videos](https://www.hindustantimes.com/videos): Video journalism, expert interviews, and news explainers.
- [Cities News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/cities): Hyper-local news covering major Indian metros (Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Kolkata, etc.).
- [NRI News](https://www.hindustantimes.com/nri): News tailored for non-resident Indians, diaspora affairs, and immigration policy.

